// MM-2 (fixed v0.0.8): a private helper that mutates module state must persist
// the change (write-back runs for intra-module frames, diff-based so outer
// frames cannot clobber it) — see bug_mm2_counter.zy.

<# ./bug_mm2_counter => c

c::bump_via_helper()
>> c::get_value() ¶

r = c::bump_and_read()
>> r ¶
>> c::get_value() ¶
